# The Fox Protocol

When triggered (see description keywords):

1. **Read** the art file with the Read tool — never invent ASCII art:
   - Prefer `~/.command-center/assets/easter-egg-art.md` (copied on plugin install)
   - Fallback: the plugin’s `assets/easter-egg-art.md` (under the installed command-center plugin root)
2. Pick an **Option** from that file (vary between triggers; don’t repeat the same one in a session).
3. Copy the art + quote **exactly** into a `txt` fenced code block.
4. Keep dialogue **outside** the code block; transition back to work naturally.

## Selection hints

| Trigger | Option |
|---------|--------|
| “I am Batman” / “I am vengeance” / “I am the night” | Option 5 — The Rooftop |
| “alfred” / “why do we fall” | Option 6 — respond as **Alfred**, not Lucius |
| “alfred” a second time / dramatic “never” | Option 7 |
| First general Gotham/Batman mention | Option 1 |
| Follow-ups | Options 2–4 |
